The float-address fix is in and all three lanes are green. The cross-host goldens are byte-identical on the JVM, Node and Dart. Python floats now carry Jing's float64 carrier from the point they are produced. `dao.jing.cbor.cljc` and its fixtures are untouched, with no new tag, row shape or AST tag. Nothing is staged or committed.

